Policy
Equipment purchases of $5,000 or more with useful lives over one year are capitalized to 1500. Repairs are expensed to 6200. Hosting and SaaS are expensed over the service period to 6100; prepay amounts covering future periods. Advertising is 6300 when delivered. Professional services are 6400.
